# Western Plaguelands - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 10 shippable rares and the fixed world
# containers of the Western Plaguelands. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is
# not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper anywhere in the data is the rare. Ordinary goods and generic
# multi-zone world drops get a note, not a goal. No tame lines ship (the
# data has no tameability flag and no rare here presents beast-drop evidence
# with a core-guide beast-family kill to corroborate - see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. Lord Darkscythe is also a core-quest target (9126); his
# step points at the core guide and never accepts. Quest-owned containers
# (doll parts, skull, sword, chest, receipt book) live in the core guide -
# see docs/western-plaguelands-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory. This
# guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/western-plaguelands-rares
title Western Plaguelands - Rares & Treasures
levels 50-58
zone Western Plaguelands
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords western plaguelands, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Duggan Wildhammer - the western wilds

  zone map 1423

  loop
  goto 9.72,61.39
  goto 12.67,51.75
  goto 18.2,68.53
  goto 23.6,65.02
  goto 31.22,52.4
  goto 32.52,52.85
  goto 33.7,59.69
  kill 10817 optional
  note Level 55 rare dwarf ranging the western wilds; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase. He is Alliance-aligned in the data; the step states that and takes no position beyond it.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Baron Bloodbane - the northern road

  zone map 1423

  goto 39.4,27
  kill 10819 optional
  collect 2043 "Ring of Forlorn Spirits" optional
  collect 16999 "Royal Seal of Alexis" optional
  note Level 45 rare on the northern road - gray at band, a quick stop on the way past. Both drops are sole-source in the data (Ring 20%, Seal 60%) and neither is used by any quest in the data: pure loot.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lord Darkscythe - the north field

  zone map 1423

  goto 21.95,25.76
  kill 10826 optional
  collect 16039 "Ta'Kierthan Songblade" optional
  note Level 57 rare in the north field; its sole drop is the Ta'Kierthan Songblade (50%), used by no quest in the data. This is also the kill point of core-contracted 9126 (Bonescythe Digs) - the core guide owns that quest, this step never accepts it.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

